From 39a9b0f2e602ad92b30fc0610c2515fd063fa5c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:51:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] API 37 (FORK-10 f): entities.items-in-box and
 take-dropped-item

items-in-box lists the item entities lying in a box (id, stack, position; the nearest to the centre first, up to 256) from the level in place; take-dropped-item takes count items from one after the call (the entity goes when none are left, mods hear it leave). The Robit's pickup and the Laser Tractor Beam's attraction use them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
